From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opi4 <opi4@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:40:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] fbcon: show the boot logo on quiet boots too

GloDroid boots with 'quiet', and fbcon skips the logo then. Kernel messages only go
to ttyS2 (console=ttyS2), so the screen gets the logo and no text either way.
---
diff --git a/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c b/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c
index 903823c..96d578e 100644
--- a/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c
+++ b/drivers/video/fbdev/core/fbcon.c
@@ -1043,9 +1043,6 @@ static void fbcon_init(struct vc_data *vc, bool init)
 
 	info = fbcon_info_from_console(vc->vc_num);
 
-	if (logo_shown < 0 && console_loglevel <= CONSOLE_LOGLEVEL_QUIET)
-		logo_shown = FBCON_LOGO_DONTSHOW;
-
 	if (vc != svc || logo_shown == FBCON_LOGO_DONTSHOW ||
 	    (info->fix.type == FB_TYPE_TEXT))
 		logo = 0;
-- 
2.34.1
